            "review_title": "Review at Mimosa Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Mulder99\n11 contributions\n0\nMimosa in Saigon....stay away.\nMay 2025 • Couples\nWe chose it because the menu was varied enough for us to eat something not asian. We were immediately seated after being solicited on the street. I asked if they accepted plastic (I.e. credit) and they said yes. We were given menus and ordered drinks and food at the same time. \n\nOur drinks did not come for a good 20 minutes until we asked for them. I ordered a 12 inch pizza. They came out a few minutes later saying they only had medium 10ninchbpizzas when their menu clearly listed 8\", 10\" and 12 \" pizzas.\n\nOk. Sonic ordered a 10\". My wife ordered a steak plate. \n\nWe waited a really long time and finally thebpizza came out. Mybwife said to not wait and eat it while it was hot. I finished it before her steak plate came out. Terrible timing of plates.\n\nWe were constantly vended to bybstreet vendors as we sat there. The restaurant obviously condones it.\n\nAnd to topnitball off I asked today with credit and the lad who was helping bus said they have no credit card capability and if I wanted to use plastic we could go with him next door to another business they have a deal with for credit card purchases. Butbitbqoukd coat a 5% surcharge \n\nI opted to pay cash and get the hece\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 12, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
