            "review_title": "Review at Mimosa Restaurant",
            "review_text": "tradkelly\nLittleton, Colorado15 contributions\n0\nA bit of family on Bui Vien.\nDec 2019\nI cannot speak to their Italian or Mexican menu items, but when we stayed locally the proprietors took us in and took care of us for the several days of our stay. You can find more expensive local food, but you'll be happy with most of their offerings. The pork in hot pot (ask for spicy), garlic and morning glory, and satays were very decent; just enough without being too much in any manner, and for a reasonable budget ($10-15/meal for two, with beer). I would certainly recommend trying Mimosa over one of the club restaurants closer to the middle of the street.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten December 22, 2019",
