            "review_title": "Review at Mimosa Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Persida R\nBucharest, Romania40 contributions\n0\nDelicious everything!\nFeb 2019 • Friends\nThis is my 3rd time eating here. I have chosen to come back everytime because of the deliciousness of the food. It looks like a very local joint, rather small but almost always full. Food is super fresh and tasty. Lots of things to choose from but I strongly recommend the vietnamese meals, as well as the clams and other seafood that you can pick from the front of the restaurant. Prices are on the Saigon level, a good meal can cost from 70,000 to 150,000 vnd, which is $3-$7 or more for the all those types of seafood - crab, shrimp, clams, oysters, scallops etc.. I have loved the shrimp and cashew nuts meal. I have just ordered it again.\nRead more\nWritten February 18, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
