            "review_text": "750Jan\nPrague, Czech Republic29 contributions\n0\nExcellent seafood\nJan 2019 • Family\nIn Bui Vien street but a bit calmer. Excellent seafood - crab, snails, clams, oysters, prawns. The clams are outstanding, we had raw oysters that were delicious. Staff is friendly, efficient, prices decent. Also Vietnamese and Mexicans. We were there 4 times. My best culinary experience in Vietnam.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 10, 2019",
