            "review_title": "Review at Mimosa Restaurant",
            "review_text": "toshboro\nmiddlesbrough72 contributions\n0\nThe aroma of the food is amazing\nJun 2017 • Solo\nI drink in the Irish bar next door to the Mimosa and every time I go the aroma of the food getting cooked is amazing. I decided to go one night and it is great. You pick your own food and they cook it there for you outside. You can sit inside but it's wonderful to sit outside and watch them cooking your food, plus OMG the aroma's are to die for. If you want to sit outside I would suggest you go early evening because it does get crowded later on especially at the weekend. It is worth going just for the aroma, I can't emphasise enough the experience. Reasonably priced but again if they could bottle that aroma I'd buy a dozen.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 14, 2017",
